      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Given H: HyperGraph, N: int, M: int, HE: Hyper Edge\n\nRandom Walk: H * N * M --> ([HE(0), ...., HE(N)] | 0 < len(HE) < M)\n\n==> HE represent meta relationship between entities\n==> Rel adopted randomly ==> Space for improvement\n\n",
      "fontSize": 51.408526995065166,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Given H: HyperGraph, N: int, M: int, HE: Hyper Edge\n\nRandom Walk: H * N * M --> ([HE(0), ...., HE(N)] | 0 < len(HE) < M)\n\n==> HE represent meta relationship between entities\n==> Rel adopted randomly ==> Space for improvement\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
